      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***EMAIL ONLY***\nKelly's Bay Inlet is a beautifully presented four-bedroom semi-detached home, offering spacious and modern accommodation in excellent condition throughout.\nThe accommodation includes a convenient guest WC on the ground floor, a master bedroom with en-suite bathroom, and built-in wardrobes in all four bedrooms, providing ample storage space.\nLocated within the sought-after Kelly's Bay development, a contemporary residential community built to a high specification, the property enjoys a superb location close to a wide range of amenities, including shops, schools, and the train station, all within easy reach."
      },
